{"name":"居中窄栏布局","description":"居中窄栏布局是一种限制内容栏宽度并将其置于页面中央的页面结构 · 文章阅读、登录和设置页面可用居中栏减少视线横向移动，让主任务更集中。具体宽度要根据中文或英文、字号和设备测试；需要品牌说明、帮助入口或多步流程时，可以保留这些必要上下文，不能把所有页面机械压成窄栏。","quote":"内容别铺满全屏，中间窄窄一条、两边留白，像博客那样。","agentPrompt":"请把博客正文改为居中窄栏，根据中英文、字号和设备测试可读最大宽度，段落保持左对齐。两侧留白随视口变化，手机保留安全内边距；检查代码块和图片可以在需要时适度超出正文栏。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-centered-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>居中窄栏布局<span>Centered Column</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">内容别铺满全屏，中间窄窄一条、两边留白，像博客那样。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">居中窄栏布局是一种限制内容栏宽度并将其置于页面中央的页面结构</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>文章阅读、登录和设置页面可用居中栏减少视线横向移动，让主任务更集中。具体宽度要根据中文或英文、字号和设备测试；需要品牌说明、帮助入口或多步流程时，可以保留这些必要上下文，不能把所有页面机械压成窄栏。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"centered-wire\">\n    <span class=\"centered-wire-col\">内容栏<em>居中限宽 600~720px</em></span>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把博客正文改为居中窄栏，根据中英文、字号和设备测试可读最大宽度，段落保持左对齐。两侧留白随视口变化，手机保留安全内边距；检查代码块和图片可以在需要时适度超出正文栏。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>行宽 60~75 字符</b>：眼球不用长途移动，见 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/typography?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"typography\" aria-label=\"排版 Typography\">排版 <b>Typography</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:66%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand)\">↔ 一行 60~75 字符</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>大留白聚焦</b>：两侧的空白是设计的一部分</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:block;width:46%;background:var(--bg);border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center\">内容栏</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>登录、注册</b>：一张窄卡片放页面正中</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-input \">ans-studio</span><span class=\"mk-input \">••••••••</span><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">登录</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>长文阅读</b>：正文限宽，配好字号行高</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.9;text-align:left\">正文的字号与行高要清楚易读，长文才容易持续阅读。</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">宽屏正文<b>未限宽</b>：单行字符过多会影响阅读</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:98%;background:#ffd4cf\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">窄栏放入仪表盘：<b>网格空间不足</b>，数据界面可使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/sidebar-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"sidebar-layout\" aria-label=\"左侧栏布局 Sidebar\">左侧栏布局 <b>Sidebar</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:center\"><span style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:2px;width:46%\"><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px\"></span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">登录卡片<b>未居中</b>：会造成两侧留白失衡</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"display:block;width:44%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">登录卡片</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">长正文使用<b>居中对齐</b>：每行起点不一致，阅读效率降低</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:70%;margin:0 auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:center;line-height:1.7\">这是一段居中对齐的长正文，每行的起点都不一样，读两行就开始费劲。</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"page\"><span class=\"centered-wire centered-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"column\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"content\"><span class=\"centered-anat-content\">登录卡片</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"page\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">页面留白</span><span class=\"pe\">Page</span></button><span class=\"pd\">两侧空白，帮注意力聚焦到中间</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"column\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">内容栏</span><span class=\"pe\">Column</span></button><span class=\"pd\">居中限宽 600~720px，一行 60~75 字符</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"content\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">内容本体</span><span class=\"pe\">Content</span></button><span class=\"pd\">文章、表单或一张登录卡片</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">阅读栏<span>Reading</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:6px 0\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:60%;min-height:0;padding:4px\"><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:90%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:95%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">长文阅读，一行 60~75 字符</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">登录卡片<span>Auth Card</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:8px 0\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:44%;min-height:0;padding:5px;border-style:solid\"><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:70%;height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);margin:3px auto 1px\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">登录、注册、找回密码</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">表单栏<span>Form</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"centered-wire\" style=\"width:110px;padding:6px 0;justify-content:flex-start;padding-left:22px\"><span class=\"centered-wire-col\" style=\"width:56%;min-height:0;padding:4px;align-items:flex-start\"><i style=\"display:block;width:34%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin:1px 0 3px\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:34%;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover);margin:2px 0\"></i><i style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:5px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin:1px 0\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">设置页、单列表单</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">博客文章页</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:6px\">为什么我把博客迁到了静态站</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px\">\n          <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">阿梨 · 3 天前 · 6 分钟读完</span>\n        </div>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:94%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:97%;margin-bottom:5px\"></i>\n        <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">登录注册</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:230px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px\">\n          <span class=\"tab active\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px\">登录</span>\n          <span class=\"tab\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px\">注册</span>\n        </div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px\" type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;padding:5px;font-size:12px\">登 录</button>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:7px\">忘记密码？</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">设置表单</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:9px\">个人资料</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n          <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px\">更换头像</button>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:3px\">昵称</div>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px\" value=\"阿梨\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">每周精选邮件</span>\n          <label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">订阅确认页</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:8px;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:240px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;padding:15px 16px\">\n        <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;margin:0 auto 8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px\">✓</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:3px\">订阅成功！</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:10px\">每周五早 8 点，《前端周刊》准时送达 you@example.com</div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:4px 14px;font-size:12px\">回到首页</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://web.dev/learn/design/typography/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">排版</span><span class=\"reference-source\">web.dev ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/centered-layout","markdown":"# 居中窄栏布局Centered Column\n\n你可能会说\n内容别铺满全屏，中间窄窄一条、两边留白，像博客那样。\n\n**居中窄栏布局是一种限制内容栏宽度并将其置于页面中央的页面结构**·文章阅读、登录和设置页面可用居中栏减少视线横向移动，让主任务更集中。具体宽度要根据中文或英文、字号和设备测试；需要品牌说明、帮助入口或多步流程时，可以保留这些必要上下文，不能把所有页面机械压成窄栏。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请把博客正文改为居中窄栏，根据中英文、字号和设备测试可读最大宽度，段落保持左对齐。两侧留白随视口变化，手机保留安全内边距；检查代码块和图片可以在需要时适度超出正文栏。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **行宽 60~75 字符**：眼球不用长途移动，见 [排版 **Typography**](/vibe-hub/typography?lang=zh)\n\n↔ 一行 60~75 字符\n- **大留白聚焦**：两侧的空白是设计的一部分\n\n内容栏\n- **登录、注册**：一张窄卡片放页面正中\n\nans-studio••••••••\n登录\n- **长文阅读**：正文限宽，配好字号行高\n\n正文的字号与行高要清楚易读，长文才容易持续阅读。\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 宽屏正文**未限宽**：单行字符过多会影响阅读\n- 窄栏放入仪表盘：**网格空间不足**，数据界面可使用 [左侧栏布局 **Sidebar**](/vibe-hub/sidebar-layout?lang=zh)\n- 登录卡片**未居中**：会造成两侧留白失衡\n\n登录卡片\n- 长正文使用**居中对齐**：每行起点不一致，阅读效率降低\n\n这是一段居中对齐的长正文，每行的起点都不一样，读两行就开始费劲。\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n登录卡片\n\n1页面留白Page两侧空白，帮注意力聚焦到中间\n\n2内容栏Column居中限宽 600~720px，一行 60~75 字符\n\n3内容本体Content文章、表单或一张登录卡片\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n阅读栏Reading\n\n长文阅读，一行 60~75 字符\n\n登录卡片Auth Card\n\n登录、注册、找回密码\n\n表单栏Form\n\n设置页、单列表单\n\n典型使用场景\n\n博客文章页\n\n为什么我把博客迁到了静态站\n\n        \n阿梨 · 3 天前 · 6 分钟读完\n\n登录注册\n\n登录\n          注册\n\n        \n        \n        登 录\n        \n忘记密码？\n\n设置表单\n\n个人资料\n\n        \n更换头像\n\n        \n昵称\n\n        \n        \n每周精选邮件\n\n订阅确认页\n\n✓\n\n        \n订阅成功！\n\n        \n每周五早 8 点，《前端周刊》准时送达 you@example.com\n\n        回到首页\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[排版web.dev ↗](https://web.dev/learn/design/typography/)"}